---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Sobre | signal::archive"
  description="Um manifesto sobre clareza, arquitetura da informação e interfaces digitais com intenção."
  lang="pt"
>
  <main class="page-shell">
    <header class="page-header">
      <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="manifesto.eyebrow">Sobre</p>
      <h1 data-i18n="manifesto.heading">Estruturas simples. Sinais claros. Sistema robusto.</h1>
    </header>

    <section class="block story-block" aria-labelledby="story-title">
      <div class="block-head">
        <h2 id="story-title" class="block-title">Manifesto</h2>
        <span class="block-count">04</span>
      </div>

      <div class="story-panel">
        <div class="content-grid">
          <article class="story">
            <p data-i18n="manifesto.body">
              signal::archive nasce da convicção de que a web precisa ser mais legível, mais consistente
              e mais útil. Em vez de ruído, buscamos clareza. Em vez de excesso, buscamos contexto.
              Em vez de tendência, buscamos intenção.
            </p>
          </article>

          <aside class="principles">
            <h2>Princípios</h2>
            <ul>
              <li>Clareza em vez de excesso.</li>
              <li>Estrutura em vez de improviso.</li>
              <li>Consistência em vez de tendência.</li>
              <li>Uso real em vez de estética vazia.</li>
            </ul>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-shell {
    --c-cyan: #00e5ff;
    --c-magenta: #ff2bd6;
    --c-yellow: #ffe600;
    --c-lime: #7dff3a;
    --c-orange: #ff6a00;
    --c-violet: #9b6bff;
    --on-accent: #05050a;

    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    max-width: 72rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 10vh 1.5rem 5rem;
    color: var(--clr-text);
    background: var(--clr-bg);
  }

  :global(html.theme-light) .page-shell {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f5f5f0 0%, #ffffff 100%);
  }

  .page-shell::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: -1;
    pointer-events: none;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(color-mix(in srgb, var(--c-cyan) 16%, transparent) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--c-magenta) 12%, transparent) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 32px 32px;
  }

  .page-header {
    max-width: 48rem;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    padding: 0.45rem 0.7rem;
    border: 2px solid var(--clr-text);
    background: var(--c-lime);
    color: var(--on-accent);
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--clr-text);
    font-family: "Press Start 2P", "Microsoft Sans Serif", monospace;
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .eyebrow::before {
    content: "$ ";
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  h1::after {
    content: "";
    display: block;
    width: min(100%, 20rem);
    height: 10px;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      var(--c-cyan) 0 25%,
      var(--c-magenta) 0 50%,
      var(--c-yellow) 0 75%,
      var(--c-lime) 0
    );
    border: 2px solid var(--clr-text);
    box-sizing: content-box;
  }

  .block {
    color: var(--clr-text);
  }

  .block-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.9rem;
    border: 3px solid var(--clr-text);
    background: var(--c-magenta);
    color: var(--on-accent);
    box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--clr-text);
  }

  .block-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--on-accent);
  }

  .block-count {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-width: 2.5rem;
    min-height: 2.5rem;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.5rem;
    border: 2px solid var(--on-accent);
    background: var(--c-yellow);
    color: var(--on-accent);
    font-family: "Press Start 2P", "Microsoft Sans Serif", monospace;
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--on-accent);
  }

  .story-panel {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding: clamp(1.25rem, 2vw, 2rem);
    border: 3px solid var(--clr-text);
    background: rgba(12, 13, 20, 0.72);
    box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--clr-text);
  }

  :global(html.theme-light) .story-panel {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
  }

  .content-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.7fr 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .story {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .story p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .principles {
    padding: 1.25rem;
    border: 2px solid var(--clr-text);
    background: var(--c-cyan);
    color: var(--on-accent);
    box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--clr-text);
  }

  .principles h2 {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--on-accent);
  }

  .principles ul {
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .principles li {
    padding: 0.75rem 0.5rem;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--clr-text);
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--on-accent);
  }

  .principles li:first-child {
    border-top: 0;
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .content-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 40rem) {
    .page-shell { padding-inline: 1rem; }
    .block-head { box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--clr-text); }
    .story-panel { box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 var(--clr-text); }
  }
</style>
